Subject: [PATCH 2/8] Merge Cards PyQt5 GUI: fix coordinate mapping and remove
 drag state

- main.py: Corrected cell_center() to map API y=0 (bottom) to widget bottom, aligning with new row insertion logic
- main.py: Updated paintEvent() to draw cards in correct vertical order based on fixed coordinate system
- main.py: Removed unused drag_col and drag_pos attributes from BoardWidget initialization
- main.py: Adjusted danger line detection to check top visible row (size[1]-1) instead of index 0
